# A person's own data. These land in the folder when someone uses the app here, and they hold real
# names, jobs and notes. Never commit them. (The demo file is docs/examples/inbox-demo.js.)
# The app names an export searchdesk-<date>.json, for example searchdesk-2026-10-16.json. Keep this
# pattern in step with Desk.io.filename; tests/unit/io.test.js fails if the two drift apart.
searchdesk-*.json
